#. defenceView
#: src/js/phantasm.js:365
msgctxt "text:defenceView"
msgid ""
"A dream is not a wastebasket for rejected options. Bring the reason you "
"discarded it in a form I can eat."
msgstr "夢不是把沒採用方案丟進去的紙簍。連同你丟掉它的理由，一起整理成我吃得下的樣子。"
